00:37:27.510 --> 00:37:29.240
Yes, yes, yes, it will shut me up.


00:37:31.120 --> 00:37:32.620
Oh, thank you.


00:37:34.920 --> 00:37:36.580
You guys are the...


00:37:38.170 --> 00:37:39.170
