- I don't know.


00:39:57.970 --> 00:39:59.430
Are you dead?


00:40:07.730 --> 00:40:10.300
Oh, yeah, he's very not alive.


00:40:10.500 --> 00:40:12.390
Not alive. Oh, boy.


00:40:12.590 --> 00:40:14.390
