- Yeah!


00:40:14.590 --> 00:40:16.640
Yeah, I killed him! I killed him!


00:40:18.340 --> 00:40:20.400
Oh, my God, I killed a man.


00:40:20.600 --> 00:40:23.190
I killed a man. No.


