01:19:28.220 --> 01:19:30.580
♪ <i>Thrust from the sky ♪</i>


01:19:30.780 --> 01:19:34.720
♪ <i>Never revealing their depth ♪</i>


01:19:35.310 --> 01:19:37.140
♪ <i>And tell me ♪</i>


01:19:37.640 --> 01:19:40.420
♪ <i>We belong together ♪</i>


01:19:40.620 --> 01:19:44.930
♪ <i>Dress it up with the trappings of love ♪</i>


01:19:45.130 --> 01:19:47.510
♪ <i>I'll be captivated ♪</i>


01:19:47.710 --> 01:19:50.220
♪ <i>I'll hang from your lips ♪</i>


01:19:50.420 --> 01:19:52.520
♪ <i>Instead of the gallows ♪</i>


01:19:52.720 --> 01:19:58.020
♪ <i>Of heartaches</i>
<i>That hang from above ♪</i>


01:19:58.220 --> 01:20:03.610
♪ <i>And I'll be your cryin' shoulder ♪</i>


01:20:03.810 --> 01:20:08.160
