- That's right, baby.


01:21:04.160 --> 01:21:06.230
- No, no, no.
- What the...


01:21:06.730 --> 01:21:07.820
Drop the guns.


01:21:10.320 --> 01:21:11.760
No.


01:21:24.060 --> 01:21:25.740
