01:21:43.310 --> 01:21:45.400
Darcy? Give me a meatball.


01:21:45.690 --> 01:21:46.860
Shit.


01:22:02.910 --> 01:22:04.190
I know where to go!


01:22:04.390 --> 01:22:06.150
Let's get moving! Out of the pool!


01:22:06.350 --> 01:22:07.706
