- Come on! Come, come, come!


01:22:07.730 --> 01:22:09.170
Get out of the pool! Come on!


01:22:11.590 --> 01:22:13.950
- Yeah, let's go.
- Margy! The spa!


01:22:14.150 --> 01:22:15.490
It's safe in the spa!


01:22:15.690 --> 01:22:17.966
