in the middle of the ocean?


01:25:03.590 --> 01:25:06.000
Darcy, I'm sorry
I stopped listening to you.


01:25:06.200 --> 01:25:08.280
I just thought that
if I planned the perfect wedding,


01:25:08.410 --> 01:25:10.270
