01:25:36.170 --> 01:25:37.500
Go, go, go, go.


01:25:37.920 --> 01:25:39.760
Deedee, listen to me!


01:25:40.420 --> 01:25:43.200
Deedee, this is
a huge misunderstanding, all right?


01:25:43.400 --> 01:25:47.710
