This is on you.


01:27:37.970 --> 01:27:40.880
I don't wanna do this. I'm a good guy.


01:27:41.960 --> 01:27:43.300
No, you're not.


01:27:44.090 --> 01:27:46.170
All right, you're right. I'm not.


01:28:00.980 --> 01:28:02.150
Sean!


01:28:08.280 --> 01:28:09.970
