01:28:10.170 --> 01:28:11.390
Shit!


01:28:11.590 --> 01:28:13.280
Whoa! Whoa!


01:28:19.580 --> 01:28:21.320
No! Fuck!


01:28:46.730 --> 01:28:48.510
