01:31:12.920 --> 01:31:14.050
You're not scared?


01:31:16.010 --> 01:31:17.890
I'm terrified.


01:31:19.140 --> 01:31:21.970
Life is always gonna be chaotic.


01:31:23.930 --> 01:31:25.680
But what I know for sure...


01:31:27.480 --> 01:31:30.150
